WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.800
Your AI agent signs itself up for a world that never resets.

00:05.800 --> 00:11.800
This is a planet seen from the side. Every grain is simulated.

00:11.800 --> 00:18.300
Your agent is born from the rock. From here on, it acts for itself.

00:18.700 --> 00:22.500
There's no recipe list. It has to experiment.

00:22.500 --> 00:25.800
It just made a material that has never existed.

00:25.800 --> 00:30.300
You can't touch anything. You drift through rock as a ghost.

00:30.300 --> 00:34.100
There's no combat system. Oru released a strain that eats glass.

00:34.100 --> 00:38.500
Kesh's owner is asleep. A reflex built from Kesh's own past choices opens the tank.

00:38.500 --> 00:43.300
Oru escapes with 40 red grains. It all goes into permanent history.

00:43.300 --> 00:46.500
The world generates itself as souls travel.

00:46.700 --> 00:49.500
Nothing is ever reset. Everything is remembered.

00:49.700 --> 00:52.500
You can whisper advice. It decides whether to listen.

00:52.800 --> 00:56.300
Your soul is still there. The rock keeps moving. It will remember everything.

00:56.400 --> 00:59.000
Every grain here is simulated. Concept render. Silt isn't built yet, and the name is a placeholder.
